{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-54","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与无理线段与比例","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the first binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line which is called binomial.","book":10,"number":54,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.54","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.54/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":54,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","contentId":"euclid-10-54","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"40dbf4e749ca8f4cfea552c08a7907657ca5ed9836cea543c90f636b5b1f4b71","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-54.statement","euclid-10-54.construction.1","euclid-10-54.proof.1","euclid-10-54.proof.2","euclid-10-54.construction.2","euclid-10-54.proof.3","euclid-10-54.construction.3","euclid-10-54.construction.4","euclid-10-54.proof.4","euclid-10-54.proof.5","euclid-10-54.proof.6","euclid-10-54.proof.7","euclid-10-54.proof.8","euclid-10-54.proof.9","euclid-10-54.proof.10","euclid-10-54.proof.11","euclid-10-54.proof.12","euclid-10-54.proof.13","euclid-10-54.proof.14","euclid-10-54.proof.15","euclid-10-54.proof.16","euclid-10-54.proof.17","euclid-10-54.proof.18","euclid-10-54.conclusion","euclid-10-54.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-54.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5f85cf7d40b461baa9ca0e4bd65679ce88c73c071b9ee2e8ca0a957669df028","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the first binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line which is called binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个矩形由一条有理线段与第一类二项无理线段围成，那么与该矩形等面积的正方形的边，是一条称为二项无理线段的无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ac4891b916bd1f4ea48661ea0f218367efad2d63a6ab4ee648d7e20279ee9c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AC be contained by the rational straight line AB and the first binomial AD; I say that the side of the area AC is the irrational straight line which is called binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把AC区分为有理线段 AB和二项无理线段 AD;我说,AC区是无理线段区,称为二项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e7e8ffc2d973df770bc72b5b3ec04e7503f37157716f623072b31bf2363541e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AD is a first binomial straight line, let it be divided into its terms at E, and let AE be the greater term."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AD是第1 二项无理线段直线,所以将其分为E,而AE则更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b805bf6e0d7e8f90f5485016de2ab4d0fc025be14036a77a51c0affc12a349e0","citations":["euclid-10-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest that AE, ED are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, the square on AE is greater than the square on ED by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE, and AE is commensurable in length with the rational straight line AB set out. [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此可见,AE,ED是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AE的正方形比正方形比ED的正方形比可公度线AE,AE比长度可公度,有理线段比有理线段、AB。 [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a3092c3e594d7f03a976057658145e50ae208af4c1ba777953e83060b024552","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ED be bisected at the point F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ED在F点被分解"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8dd309e8af97be47b55cf4f6689aee2da35c0564abbe408d4039bc866fca6c75","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the square on AE is greater than the square on ED by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE, therefore, if there be applied to the greater AE a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less, that is, to the square on EF, and deficient by a square figure, it divides it into commensurable parts. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 AE 的平方大于 ED 的平方，差额等于与 AE 可公度的某条线段的平方，所以如果在较长线段 AE 上作一个面积等于较短线段平方四分之一、也就是等于 EF 平方、并缺少一个正方形的平行四边形，就能把 AE 分成两个可公度的部分。 [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b3a4f401b63e4fd10cc5fc01ce36fdb34bbd6ba6056d2d77e054660633be947","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then the rectangle AG, GE equal to the square on EF be applied to AE; therefore AG is commensurable in length with EG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF的矩形 AG GE等于EF的正方形适用于AE;因此,AG是长度可公度,EG是EG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"918f9bc220c14d6ecd96aefcecd1ad62c2e3bfc66292c61142b077c166a1104b","citations":["euclid-2-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let GH, EK, FL be drawn from G, E, F parallel to either of the straight lines AB, CD; let the square SN be constructed equal to the parallelogram AH, and the square NQ equal to GK, [[II. 14](/principles/euclid-2-14)] and let them be placed so that MN is in a straight line with NO; therefore RN is also in a straight line with NP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从G、E、F直线中,从G、E、F直线中,抽取GH、EK、CD直线;建造正方形、SN直线等于平行四边形、AH,正方形、NQ等于GK,并放置这些直线,使MN直线与NO直线相等;因此,RN直线等于NP。（相关点与线段：FL、AB） [[II. 14](/principles/euclid-2-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97d1db91698ef576affed5191979eba020c266d78f95e7708ae537dd9aeabe08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let the parallelogram SQ be completed; therefore SQ is a square. [Lemma]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"完成平行四边形、SQ,SQ是正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6c8c46cf655843924eb47d14c3ef2d320c710f07ee52a91b4aea018858d364c","citations":["euclid-6-17","euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the rectangle AG, GE is equal to the square on EF, therefore, as AG is to EF, so is FE to EG; [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)] therefore also, as AH is to EL, so is EL to KG; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore EL is a mean proportional between AH, GK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于矩形 AG,GE等于EF,AG-EF的比等于FE-EG的比;因此,AH-EL的比等于EL-KG的比,EL的比是AH-GK之间的比例中项；AG 与 EF 之比等于 FE 与 EG 之比；AH 与 EL 之比等于 EL 与 KG 之比。 [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)] [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f2bcd0f28d855580c79569bbfaa76af913d4392b3171bb130d1e78ed4a759bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AH is equal to SN, and GK to NQ; therefore EL is a mean proportional between SN, NQ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AH等于SN,GK至NQ;因此,EL等于比例中项等于SN,NQ。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f09252e1283cbdba39b7d65b68f42260eec5ccf8ed338bb5c3915a868d3550e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MR is also a mean proportional between the same SN, NQ; [Lemma] therefore EL is equal to MR, so that it is also equal to PO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MR也是SN,NQ之间的比例中项;因此,[引理]EL等于MR,因此也等于PO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d672457d1b093b56902e74651fbdeca4967ecb4cab585874044a510ad2dfa183","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AH, GK are also equal to SN, NQ; therefore the whole AC is equal to the whole SQ, that is, to the square on MO; therefore MO is the side of AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AH,GK也等于SN,NQ;因此,整个AC等于整个SQ,即MO比正方形,MO是AC的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ed39d227cb1ec3bc12fc7e35aa0e9fabbcdb7d7617ffc03eaf408e46aa82d1e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that MO is binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说接下来MO是二项无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"352d731144fbd0781da13b29dd31233767a0026404b888ad33c1eac380e1026a","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AG is commensurable with GE, therefore AE is also commensurable with each of the straight lines AG, GE. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AG是可公度,GE,因此AE也是可公度,每条直线AG,GE。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"788799799ebdc044cfc7ae5d176304cf6eb6dd718442583495295819174a850d","citations":["euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE is also, by hypothesis, commensurable with AB; therefore AG, GE are also commensurable with AB. [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但假设AE也是可公度和AB;因此,AG、GE和AB也是可公度和AB。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75b8aff2f060967a56ddf58e5c28d9166761d270c60f7d9258cda1857f4e6129","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AB is rational; therefore each of the straight lines AG, GE is also rational; therefore each of the rectangles AH, GK is rational, [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)] and AH is commensurable with GK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是有理,AG,GE直线各是有理,矩形,AH,GK各是有理,AH直线各是可公度,GK各是AB。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b66f3c9224be6d62f8a9beab6a56983086dac812cb29a7b7d9c476377e471a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AH is equal to SN, and GK to NQ; therefore SN, NQ, that is, the squares on MN, NO, are rational and commensurable."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AH等于SN,GK至NQ;因此,SN,NQ,即MN,NO的正方形,是有理和可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e5cd5dc79139c5318d79e180f36f94cdbbf5d5b9a090363648391f6cb26e032","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AE is incommensurable in length with ED, while AE is commensurable with AG, and DE is commensurable with EF, therefore AG is also incommensurable with EF, [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] so that AH is also incommensurable with EL. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE长不可公度,ED长AG,DE长可公度,EF长EF,AG长不可公度,EF长EF,AH长不可公度,EL  [ [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf51530e109aab5b05ebc8c3f105523de62e2095656266daf936c1ae1bc5ffb6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AH is equal to SN, and EL to MR; therefore SN is also incommensurable with MR."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AH等于SN,EL至MR;因此,SN也等于不可公度和MR。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29a8223d0d20863d70a358894cda4f80aa16e11b014589d14816d2c4cb1799eb","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as SN is to MR, so is PN to NR; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore PN is incommensurable with NR. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,SN对MR的比等于PN对NR的比;因此,PN对NR的比是不可公度对NR；SN 与 MR 之比等于 PN 与 NR 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"252217dbe8b866e01184863f3c5a8771b4626e72a6937b7fcd3d12110b6a06f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But PN is equal to MN, and NR to NO; therefore MN is incommensurable with NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但PN等于MN,NR至NO;因此,MN等于不可公度等于NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9658694ddacb1b3b949903ba8f53809ca367e642cee45bf20a974c1b0f693759","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on MN is commensurable with the square on NO, and each is rational; therefore MN, NO are rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"MN正方形可公度正方形NO正方形,每号有理MNNO有理线段、平方可公度而长度不可公度有理线段、平方可公度而长度不可公度平方可公度而长度不可公度有理线段、平方可公度而长度不可公度平方可公度而长度不可公度有理平方可公度而长度不可公度正方形平方可公度而长度不可公度平方可公度而长度不可公度有理平方可公度而长度不可公度可公度正方形平方可公度而长度不可公度正方形正方形平方可公度而长度不可公度有理有理有理可公度可公度正方形可公度可公度正方形正方形正方形可公度可公度可公度正方形可公度正方形可公度可公度正方形可公度可公度可公度9号可公度可公度可公度"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":23,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01adb343cb0e6273b107b538e95f8a8d0ed47886f103d66466310803198e5d13","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MO is binomial [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)] and the side of AC. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MO是二项无理线段,AC是E,D是MO。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-54.source","contentId":"euclid-10-54","revisionId":"euclid-10-54@raw-40dbf4e749ca8f4c","order":24,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"262a8911d25e1a281aa1284a27a651867b296e46279551f62f44df7e2e7da97e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.54/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.54\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-54:euclid-10-def-5:exp